WEBVTT

00:11:25.537 --> 00:11:32.454
an academic named William Bridges
who studied life transition.

00:11:32.912 --> 00:11:37.579
He died several years ago, but his wife,
Susan Bridges, now continues his work.

00:11:37.579 --> 00:11:42.037
They've got an institute, the William
and Susan Bridges Institute,

00:11:42.329 --> 00:11:44.287
where they study life transition.

00:11:44.621 --> 00:11:50.121
And essentially William Bridges's
model is as follows.

00:11:50.121 --> 00:11:57.037
He analyzed data over decades of people
experiencing life transitions.

00:11:57.704 --> 00:12:03.371
